":"Rule parse error in rule security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules-audit.java.struts2.security.audit.entrypoints.convention-annotation-class-method:\n Invalid pattern for Java: Stdlib.Parsing.Parse_error\n----- pattern -----\n@$ANNOTATION($...PARAMS)\nclass $CLASS\n\n----- end pattern -----\n"}},{"descriptor":{"id":"Rule parse error"},"level":"error","message":{"text":"Rule parse error in rule security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.java.spring.security.audit.remoting.UnsafeHttpInvokerServiceExporter-extends:\n Invalid pattern for Java: Stdlib.Parsing.Parse_error\n----- pattern -----\nclass $CLASS extends org.springframework.remoting.rmi.RemoteInvocationSerializingExporter\n\n----- end pattern -----\n"}}]}],"results":[],"tool":{"driver":{"name":"Semgrep OSS","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Process execution detected $EXEC"},"help":{"markdown":"Process execution detected $EXEC","text":"Process execution detected $EXEC"},"id":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules-audit.c.lang.security.audit.exec","name":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules-audit.c.lang.security.audit.exec","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["LOW CONFIDENCE"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules-audit.c.lang.security.audit.exec"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"note"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Dynamic OrderBy using string/expression. If understanding of property paths is attacker-controlled, this can aid schema inference and leaks."},"help":{"markdown":"Dynamic OrderBy using string/expression. If understanding of property paths is attacker-controlled, this can aid schema inference and leaks.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/203.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/203.html)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-Broken_Access_Control/](https://owasp.org/Top10/A01_2021-B