ating systems. On Linux symlinks are followed, while on MacOS and Windows they are not. Depending on context, this could lead to file replacement attacks and local privilege escalation."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.potential-symlink-takeover-with-os.executable","name":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.potential-symlink-takeover-with-os.executable","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["LOW CONFIDENCE"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.potential-symlink-takeover-with-os.executable"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"fmt.Sprintf()'s %s formatting verb does not escape control characters in a string, such as \\u000a or backtick-enclosed multilines. This could lead to various vulnerabilities such as header injection, request smuggling, log injection, etc."},"help":{"markdown":"fmt.Sprintf()'s %s formatting verb does not escape control characters in a string, such as \\u000a or backtick-enclosed multilines. This could lead to various vulnerabilities such as header injection, request smuggling, log injection, etc.","text":"fmt.Sprintf()'s %s formatting verb does not escape control characters in a string, such as \\u000a or backtick-enclosed multilines. This could lead to various vulnerabilities such as header injection, request smuggling, log injection, etc."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.sprintf-unescaped-control-characters","name":"security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.sprintf-unescaped-control-characters","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["MEDIUM CONFIDENCE"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep.repos.elttam-semgrep-rules.rules.go.lang.security.audit.sprintf-unescaped-control-characters"}},{"de